        "note": "表示时间段的词语用在动词后面构成时量补语，说明动作或状态持续的时间。基本结构：主语＋动词＋时量补语。动词带宾语时，事物名词一般在时量补语后，称呼或代词一般在时量补语前；也可以重复动词后再加时量补语。动词是离合词时，需要重复动词性语素。动词后有“了”、句尾还有语气助词“了”，表示动作仍在进行。",
        "noteEn": "Time expressions are used after verbs to form complements of duration, indicating the length of time an action or a state lasts. Basic structure: Subject + Verb + Complement of Duration. If the object is a thing noun, it is usually placed after the complement; if it is a term of address or a pronoun, it is usually placed before. The verb can also be repeated before adding the complement, and a separable word repeats its verbal morpheme. With “了” after the verb and another “了” at the end, the action is still ongoing.",
